tatus\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSummit all-sky\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe view from Cerro Pachón is available live via the \u003ca href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/epo_rubintv_data/all_sky_current/all_sky_current.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ecurrent all-sky camera image\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eNightly summaries\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAutomated per-night reports are available from the \u003ca href=\"https://s3df.slac.stanford.edu/data/rubin/sim-data/schedview/reports/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003escheduler reports\u003c/a\u003e page by clicking \"nightsum\" in the table for the desired date.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/p\u003efd:[\"$\",\"$L2e\",null,{\"darkMode\":false,\"bgColor\":\"transparent\",\"paddingSize\":\"medium\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-cy\":\"rich-text-content\",\"className\":\"styles_contentRte__pTD0X\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$104\"}}]}]\nfe:[\"$\",\"$L105\",null,{\"__typename\":\"contentBlocks_summitStatusCompactView_BlockType\",\"id\":\"246071\",\"typeHandle\":\"summitStatusCompactView\",\"showWeatherCondition\":true,\"weatherConditionTooltipText\":\"Current weather conditions on Cerro Pachón.\",\"showAllSkyIma"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ge\":true,\"allSkyImageTooltipText\":\"Current all-sky camera from Cerro Pachón.\",\"showDomeStatus\":true,\"domeStatusTooltipText\":\"Current dome status (open or closed).\",\"showExposureCount\":false,\"exposureCountTooltipText\":\"Number of exposures obtained (nightly).\",\"showAlertCount\":true,\"alertCountTooltipText\":\"Number of alerts transmitted (nightly).\",\"showSurveyProgress\":false,\"surveyProgressTooltipText\":null,\"showSunsetSunriseTimes\":true,\"sunsetSunriseTimesTooltipText\":\"Sunrise and sunset times on Cerro Pachón.\",\"showWildlifeGallerySpotlight\":false,\"wildlifeGallery\":[],\"wildlifeGallerySpotlightTooltipText\":null,\"summitStatusDashboardCap