<p>For updates on scheduled and unscheduled downtime (multi-day events due to, e.g., engineering projects, inclement weather) check the <a href="https://community.lsst.org/c/news/7" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">News category</a> of the Rubin Community Forum or look for a banner on <a href="https://rubinobservatory.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">rubinobservatory.org</a>.</p></div></div></section><section data-testid="container" data-dark-mode="false" style="--section-background-color:var(--transparent);--size-padding-container:40px 0 40px" class="sc-acf01e18-0 fFTfeI"><div class="sc-acf01e18-1 NiPL"><div data-cy="rich-text-content" class="styles_contentRte__pTD0X"><h2>Can't find something?</h2>
<p>Questions about the LSST are welcome in the Support and Survey Strategy categories of the Rubin Community Forum.</p></div></div></section><section style="--color-background-section:var(--orange20)" data-dark-mode="false" class="sc-4439bcec-0 fFnOId"><div class="sc-4439bcec-1 cZtPPU"><header class="styles_header__tztT5"><h2>Rubin Community Forum</h2><div data-cy="rich-text-content" class="styles_contentRte__pTD0X styles_richText__z4ChI"><p>Ask questions, get help, report bugs or errors, and join in discussions about Rubin Observatory and its data products, pipelines, and services.</p></div><div class="styles_links__PtGy_" data-has-image="true"><a href="https://community.lsst.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sc-8779132c-0 bQWQZi styles_link__lCqRj c-buttonish c-buttonish--educator" type="url">Go to the Rubin Community Forum</a></div></header><img alt="decorative" data-pad-image="false" loading="lazy" width="3840" height="2240" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="styles_image__bsMEI" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2FRubin.canto.com%2Fdirect%2Fimage%2Folv9gesb9d61j0t06ep90ahj51%2FyEGALvnSECupVSxbQcPn5gFI0FE%2Fm800%2F800&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2FRubin.canto.com%2Fdirect%2Fimage%2Folv9gesb9d61j0t06ep90ahj51%2FyEGALvnSECupVSxbQcPn5gFI0FE%2Fm800%2F800&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></section></div></article></div><script>$RS("S:3","P:3")</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"10d:[]\n10c:{\"id\":\"41\",\"title\":\"History\",\"uri\":\"about/history\",\"children\":\"$10d\"}\n10f:[]\n10e:{\"id\":\"44\",\"title\":\"Who was Vera Rubin?\",\"uri\":\"about/vera-rubin\",\"children\":\"$10f\"}\n112:{\"id\":\"65835\",\"title\":\"Cerro Pachón\",\"uri\":\"about/rubin-in-chile/cerro-pachón\"}\n113:{\"id\":\"225\",\"title\":\"Observatory Site Selection\",\"uri\":\"about/rubin-in-chile/site-selection\"}\n111:[\"$112\",\"$113\"]\n110:{\"id\":\"65803\",\"title\":\"Rubin in Chile\",\"uri\":\"about/rubin-